WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.584 --> 00:00:03.253
Today, I announce
my first proclamation.

00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:06.465
She got the throne.

00:00:06.507 --> 00:00:09.218
Empress Catherine the Great!
Huzzah!

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:11.094
ALL: Huzzah!

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:13.055
ELLE: I think a big theme
of the show this year

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:15.307
is that she's becoming
a mother herself

00:00:15.349 --> 00:00:17.851
and also becoming
a mother to Russia.

00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:21.939
Look at you.

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:25.901
-At that thing.
-I call it the baby.

00:00:25.943 --> 00:00:27.736
She's obviously
trying to juggle a lot.

00:00:27.778 --> 00:00:30.280
It must be strange,
a human creature inside you.

00:00:31.073 --> 00:00:33.283
Do you ever think,
what if he has a knife?

00:00:34.076 --> 00:00:35.285
I never do.

00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:36.787
And I don't think at first

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:38.914
that Catherine
necessarily takes to it.

00:00:38.956 --> 00:00:40.749
Very odd to feel your lungs
being crushed

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:42.501
like an accordion
into your throat

00:00:42.543 --> 00:00:44.795
by a foreign invading creature
who's taken over your body.

00:00:44.837 --> 00:00:47.506
I think if God really
loved women, we'd lay eggs.

00:00:48.674 --> 00:00:52.553
Catherine being pregnant
is clearly a feminist issue.

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:55.305
Are we almost done?
I have a great deal to do.

00:00:55.347 --> 00:00:57.266
MARIAN: It has not affected
her ability to rule

00:00:57.307 --> 00:00:58.892
in any way at all.

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.269
Anyone in the room
may congratulate me

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:02.229
on my diplomatic victory!

00:01:02.271 --> 00:01:04.106
Huzzah!

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:05.732
The growing
creature within her

00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:10.112
is the growing realization of
what it means to run a nation.

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:11.947
Will you retire
to bed now, Empress?

00:01:11.989 --> 00:01:15.367
No, I have work to do.
That is why I am here.

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:19.204
Catherine's pregnancy affects
her strategy politically.

00:01:19.246 --> 00:01:21.957
I have a busy day
running Russia,

00:01:21.999 --> 00:01:24.209
the country
I just took from you.

00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:26.295
She knows that while
she's pregnant, she's safe.

00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:28.755
Everyone expects you
to last a year.

00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:30.215
I'm safe until the baby is born.

00:01:30.257 --> 00:01:32.968
This heir's coming and someone
could take the baby

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:35.137
and try and usurp her power.

00:01:35.179 --> 00:01:37.264
Peter could come and slit
my throat and take over.

00:01:37.306 --> 00:01:38.849
Imprisoned until Paul is born.

00:01:38.891 --> 00:01:40.267
You're a good dad.

00:01:40.309 --> 00:01:41.852
Look how big you are.
How's Paul?

00:01:41.894 --> 00:01:43.187
We call the baby Paul.

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:47.191
My patience is wearing thin.
Love you. Bye Paul.

00:01:47.232 --> 00:01:48.442
She's a very
progressive person

00:01:48.483 --> 00:01:50.903
in a very conservative country

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.321
that doesn't really
want to change.

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:54.239
Let us remake Russia,
my friend.

00:01:54.281 --> 00:01:56.200
So she's trying
to bring enlightenment

00:01:56.241 --> 00:01:58.785
to a country that kind of
doesn't want to change

00:01:58.827 --> 00:02:00.329
before she gives birth.

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:03.415
We must act fast and show
that I am a great leader,

00:02:03.457 --> 00:02:05.417
indispensable,
destined, and loved.

00:02:05.459 --> 00:02:08.295
Because she thinks after
I give birth, I might die.

00:02:08.337 --> 00:02:10.297
Once Paul's out,
someone will try and kill you,

00:02:10.339 --> 00:02:11.924
steal the baby,
and coup us both with it.

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:13.884
ELLE:
That's a big responsibility.

00:02:13.926 --> 00:02:15.802
People spilled blood for us

00:02:15.844 --> 00:02:18.514
and we will repay it
with sweat and toil.

00:02:18.555 --> 00:02:21.308
Catherine is actually
a contemporary woman.

00:02:22.476 --> 00:02:23.685
Well done.

00:02:23.727 --> 00:02:26.271
I will act decisively
for my country.

00:02:26.313 --> 00:02:27.898
Your arrogance is breathtaking.

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:29.691
My ambition is breathtaking.

00:02:29.733 --> 00:02:34.279
You actually see her
in different phases of pregnancy

00:02:34.321 --> 00:02:35.614
with her growing stomach.

00:02:35.656 --> 00:02:37.783
Also, you know,
the pains of pregnancy.

00:02:37.866 --> 00:02:40.536
-Oh. Yes.
-Did Paul just kick you?

00:02:40.577 --> 00:02:43.413
All while she's trying
to lead a country.

00:02:43.455 --> 00:02:44.623
I need to rest.

00:02:44.665 --> 00:02:46.792
Not that she can't do it all,
she can.

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:49.336
-Of course, she can.
-Because I am the future.

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:52.422
You have never seen
a ruler like me before.

00:02:52.464 --> 00:02:55.634
I will forge this country
into a progressive nation

00:02:55.676 --> 00:02:58.679
that electrifies Europe and the
world as to what is possible.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:01.974
God, I love your fire.
You are a wonder.

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:04.518
♪ ♪

